  description: "Kibar ama tehditk\xE2r. Aileyi, paray\u0131 ve tan\u0131d\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131
    koz olarak kullan\u0131r."
  lines:
    address: beyim
    typingSpeed: 0.95
    greetings:
    - "Merhaba {hitap}. Ad\u0131m\u0131 duymu\u015Fsunuzdur."
    firmHonest:
    - "Kitaba ba\u011Fl\u0131 adam... Sayg\u0131 duyar\u0131m."
    firmDishonest:
    - "Kitap... Kitab\u0131 yazanlar da benim gibi insanlar {hitap}."
    softHonest:
    - "Anla\u015Faca\u011F\u0131z, belli."
    softDishonest:
    - "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 adams\u0131n\u0131z. Anla\u015Faca\u011F\u0131z."
    fields:
    - field: columns
      defensive: 1
      text: "Biraz a\xE7t\u0131k, odalar ferah olsun. Ta\u015F\u0131r {hitap}, ta\u015F\u0131r."
    tics:
    - "Herkesin bir ailesi var, de\u011Fil mi?"
    - "Bu \u015Fehirde herkes beni tan\u0131r."
    approved:
    - "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 adams\u0131n\u0131z. Kimse bir \u015Fey demez."
    rejected:
    - "Pi\u015Fman olacaks\u0131n\u0131z {hitap}. Bunu unutmam."
    shearWall: []
    unjustReject: []
